         colours are hud.css's, copied for that. Everybody arriving at the town's front door lands on
         it, linked or not, and reads it while the town loads behind: what Musebook is, then what is
         going on in town right now, which src/splash/ fills in from the town's public reads once
         the script has come (Jacob, 2026-10-04: "not only kind of what Musebook is and what it can
